{"id":"8e6def3f178ba2e1","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-existential.md","title":"Existential","display":"df-existential — Existential","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-existential","aliases":["58-df-existential"],"display":"df-existential — Existential","depends_on":["[[58-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-existential"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-existential</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-existential — Existential"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (signature, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> (variable)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (formula, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\,\\varphi\">\\(\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\neg\\varphi\\)</span> (syntactic formula constructors defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}existential} \\vdash \\operatorname{Exists}_S(x,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\neg\\forall x\\,\\neg\\varphi\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}existential} \\vdash \\operatorname{Exists}_S(x,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\neg\\forall x\\,\\neg\\varphi\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}existential\\text{-}wellformed} \\vdash x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Exists}_S(x,\\varphi)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}existential\\text{-}wellformed} \\vdash x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Exists}_S(x,\\varphi)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The existential quantifier is definable from universal quantification and negation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ (signature, see [[58-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)$ (formula, see [[58-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\forall x\\,\\varphi$ and $\\neg\\varphi$ (syntactic formula constructors defined in [[58-df-formula]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\,\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}existential} \\vdash \\operatorname{Exists}_S(x,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\neg\\forall x\\,\\neg\\varphi","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}existential\\text{-}wellformed} \\vdash x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Exists}_S(x,\\varphi)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)","display":true}],"bytes":911,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-502","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-existential.md|58-df-existential]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["65418b505fc53093"]}